<title>FRANCE: France Telecom sale for 30 to 40 pct.</title>
<headline>France Telecom sale for 30 to 40 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>France Telecom chairman Michel Bon said on Friday that the partial privatisation of the company would involve a stake of 30 to 40 percent of the group's capital.</p>
<p>&quot;At the current market situation we are looking at a stake of 30 to 40 percent,&quot; he said during an interview on TF1 television on Friday morning.</p>
<p>The French government intends to raise between 30 and 50 billion francs ($8.8 billion) with the sale of shares in France Telecom. ($ = 5.668 French Francs)</p>
</text>
